            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Birnbaum, Foster; Blau, Helen; Gozani, Or; and Wu, Joseph. (2021). Modeling Cardiomyopathy of Duchenne Muscular Dystrophy in Human Induced Pluripotent Stem Cell-Derived Cardiomyocytes. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at https://purl.stanford.edu/qp023js4198",
